#   html_input_element_1 - HTML::HTMLInputElement: construction, layout, checkedness, pickers
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/HTML/HTMLInputElement.cpp (lines 1-480): is_integral_multiple, the
#       constructor (which moves the mixin tables to HTMLInputElement's, as C++'s vptrs move),
#       initialize, visit_edges, set_being_activated, the layout node, the adjusted computed
#       style, checkedness and indeterminate, the list attribute's suggestions source element,
#       the compiled pattern regular expression, the selected files and the accept attribute,
#       updating the file selection, showing the picker and showPicker(). The rest of the file
#       follows in html_input_element_2 to html_input_element_7; the inline functions of
#       HTMLInputElement.h are in html_input_element_7.
